sequenceDiagram
    participant Code as 用户代码
    participant API as startTransition
    participant Config as ReactCurrentBatchConfig
    participant Hooks as dispatchSetState
    participant Lane as Lane 引擎
    participant Root as scheduleUpdateOnFiber
    participant Sched as Scheduler 调度器
    participant WLoop as workLoopConcurrent

    Code->>API: startTransition(() => { setSearchQuery("数") })

    API->>Config: transition = { name: 'Pending' }
    Note over Config: 全局变量标记<br/>"当前在 transition 中"

    API->>Hooks: dispatchSetState(fiber, queue, "数")
    Hooks->>Lane: requestUpdateLane(fiber)
    Lane->>Config: ReactCurrentBatchConfig.transition 非 null ?
    Config-->>Lane: YES（是一个对象）
    Lane->>Lane: claimNextTransitionLane()
    Note over Lane: 返回 TransitionLane1 = 0b10000
    Lane-->>Hooks: lane = TransitionLane1

    Hooks->>Hooks: 创建 Update { lane, action: "数" }
    Hooks->>Hooks: enqueueUpdate() 追加到 searchQuery 队列

    Hooks->>Root: scheduleUpdateOnFiber(root, TransitionLane1)
    Root->>Root: markRootUpdated(root, lane)
    Root->>Root: lanesToSchedulerPriority(TransitionLane1)
    Note over Root: TransitionLane → NormalPriority<br/>(超时时间 5000ms)
    Root->>Sched: scheduleCallback(NormalPriority, workLoop)

    Note over Sched: 任务队列中小顶堆排序<br/>NormalPriority 排在<br/>UserBlocking 和 Immediate 之后

    Sched-->>Sched: 浏览器空闲 → 触发回调
    Sched->>WLoop: performConcurrentWorkOnRoot(root)
    WLoop->>Root: getNextLanes() → TransitionLane1
    Note over WLoop: renderLanes = TransitionLane1<br/>→ 透传到所有 Fiber 节点
    WLoop->>WLoop: beginWork(HeavyList Fiber)
    Note over WLoop: HeavyList({ query: "数" })<br/>filter("数") 同步执行 ~8-12ms
    WLoop->>WLoop: shouldYield() → 检查 5ms 预算

    Note over WLoop,Sched: —— 用户突然输入新字符 ——

    Code->>Root: 新输入事件 → SyncLane 插入
    Root->>Sched: 更高优先级任务到达
    Sched->>WLoop: shouldYield() → true
    WLoop->>Root: prepareFreshStack(root)
    Note over Root: workInProgress = null<br/>旧 WIP 树丢弃（GC）<br/>基于最新 state 重建
